  "trustHomeMeaning": "Counts are satellite thermal anomalies from the last 24 hours, not confirmed wildfires. Some may be agricultural burns, industrial heat, or hot surfaces.",
  "trustHomeSource": "Data comes from NASA FIRMS (Fire Information for Resource Management System), combining VIIRS and MODIS satellite passes, refreshed every 3 hours.",
