  "trustHomeAction": "Tap a detection for confidence, FRP, and limitations. If you see smoke or flames, follow official emergency guidance and report what you observe.",

  "trustMapMeaning": "Each marker is a satellite thermal anomaly, not a confirmed fire. Red means Probable Fire; orange high anomaly; yellow nominal; gray low confidence.",
